@startuml
title Payment State Machine
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
  BorderColor #2E7D32
}
[*] --> Pending
Pending --> Authorized : Card authorization
Pending --> Succeeded : Wallet, COD, or direct capture
Pending --> Failed : Initiation failed
Pending --> Voided : Payment cancelled
Authorized --> Succeeded : Capture
Authorized --> Voided : Void authorization
Succeeded --> PartiallyRefunded : Partial refund
PartiallyRefunded --> Refunded : Remaining amount refunded
Succeeded --> Refunded : Full refund
Failed --> [*]
Voided --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]
@enduml
